# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Box the circuit {#box-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Box the circuit {#box-the-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For ease of implementation, we utilize the `generate_boxing_pass_manager` transpilation pass, which places the circuit instructions into annotated boxes. These boxes clearly indicate where, in the case of PEC, anti-noise should be injected into the circuit. For details on settings, refer to the [Samplomatic documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/).\n"
msgstr "Untuk kemudahan pelaksanaan, kami menggunakan pas transpilasi `generate_boxing_pass_manager`, yang meletakkan arahan Circuit ke dalam kotak beranotasi. Kotak ini menunjukkan dengan jelas di mana, dalam kes PEC, anti-hingar harus disuntik ke dalam Circuit. Untuk butiran tentang tetapan, rujuk [dokumentasi Samplomatic](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note that the SLC workflow requires the use of `inject_noise_strategy=\"individual_modification\"` later in the process because this allows us to uniquely identify the `InjectNoise` annotations of the `BoxOp` instructions in the circuit. (Boxes without an `InjectNoise` annotation cannot be identified in this way.)\n"
msgstr "Perhatikan bahawa aliran kerja SLC memerlukan penggunaan `inject_noise_strategy=\"individual_modification\"` kemudian dalam proses kerana ini membolehkan kita mengenal pasti secara unik anotasi `InjectNoise` bagi arahan `BoxOp` dalam Circuit. (Kotak tanpa anotasi `InjectNoise` tidak boleh dikenal pasti dengan cara ini.)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\">\n"
"The SLC bound computations currently assume that the `InjectNoise` annotations are placed with `site=\"after\"` (see [qiskit-addon-slc#33](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-slc/issues/33)). Because the default value of this setting changed in recent versions of `samplomatic` (see [samplomatic#372](https://github.com/Qiskit/samplomatic/pull/372)), we set `inject_noise_site=\"after\"` explicitly below.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `find_unique_box_instructions` function iterates through the provided boxed circuit and identifies those that have unique two-qubit (2Q) layers or measurements, for the purpose of noise learning and noise injection.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi `find_unique_box_instructions` mengulangi Circuit berkotak yang disediakan dan mengenal pasti yang mempunyai lapisan dua-Qubit (2Q) atau pengukuran yang unik, bagi tujuan pembelajaran hingar dan suntikan hingar.\n"

